WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:04.869
This video shows how to create an assignment and publish it on a phone.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:13.453
Tap the menu button, open Academics and choose Assignments. Then tap Create Assignment.

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:27.432
Type the title, choose the class and the subject, then tap Select Teacher and pick the teacher.

00:00:40.569 --> 00:00:45.849
Set the due date and the total marks. The due date is required.

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.528
Write the description, which is required, and the instructions for the students.

00:01:12.475 --> 00:01:19.315
Tap Create Assignment. A message confirms it, and the new assignment appears as a Draft.

00:01:30.846 --> 00:01:37.326
Tap Publish on its card so students can see it. The status changes to Published.

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:51.790
The assignment is published, and students can now see it in their portal.
